{"v":4,"catch":"如果你的故事始於來世呢？","desc":"突然，你醒來發現自己變成了一個幽靈，失去了所有記憶。你的善行和惡行數量正好相等，所以你需要重返人間，贖清罪孽。\n\n在處理家庭事務的同時，重新發現你的前世，重溫那些感人的回憶。\n\n《Soapy Tales》將輕鬆的家務與時空管理元素巧妙結合。完成任務，提升技能，在柔和的肥皂泡中，揭開你的人生故事！\n\n主要特色：\n- 第一人稱視角遊戲。\n- 溫馨懷舊的氛圍。\n- 舒緩的音樂。\n- 可解鎖的技能樹和神器。","publisher":"REDDEER.GAMES","release":"2026-02-26","genres":["模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 1.6GB / Switch 1.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0dcb3c0af6361d77655c236c63ba5b8fe74c1d612748060aeb5daa01406fa042.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/70fd151b2c654668f840bfc98040ad63cc360934b265f8ca408c6563886a2533.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/753feb8d4690f8b08c187a6a674660fb79a70522b516143117e4c739c2950887.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4742e0bacbf69e14d0dfef1c0d1deb4030f111d4a7b172b8e98edc020eee70ff.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e36e9b1c8a67157e324033abae06afd390411b67001d1ef03965f1b27c15fac5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ea1972d0d682b69e8786588eb1565f2bbb1a6a8ad7e7474c20567f070ec56881.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b860271c8000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000071678","name":"雲朵淺藍","img":"79033c54b04b7e99d216b086d7b1fd182a4bd20e44ef1bfde8b05362df6bff01","date":"2026-04-08","mem":false},{"id":"70050000073115","name":"薄荷巧克力棒","img":"363609c24a04f89daeea7e4ecb5525e6140418b61363bcb391e0df60f5203e80","date":"2026-05-11","mem":false},{"id":"70050000076227","name":"泰迪熊和蜂蜜","img":"cee587c838bb9cfd681a832e42af85a1293182055aaefd9172f3f27b8ccb752a","date":"2026-07-11","mem":false},{"id":"70050000078527","name":"彩虹瓢蟲","img":"54a21e13d557bb43f9d8bf37cbf84fa9f734ae4b0b56e80466f18fd7cd0be1d4","date":"2026-09-08","mem":false}]}